s led me to complete my doctoral studies in Engineering Mechanics.” - Dr. Josh Fitzgerald, Class of ’19, Mathematics Major Dr. Josh Fitzgerald earned his master's from Virginia Tech University (studied astrodynamics) as well as earning an Engineering Mechanics Ph.D. He joined the NASA Johnson Space Center in Houston, TX as an Advanced Mission Design Engineer, optimizing trajectories for the Artemis II and III missions to return humans to the moon. Visit Apply Request Info Search Search Please ensure Javascript is enabled for purposes of website accessibility"
